929
00:26:55,840 --> 00:26:56,880
(ekstaatilise naeruga)

930
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:59,200
Oh, jumal!

931
00:27:01,520 --> 00:27:02,840
Vau, jah!

932
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:08,320
Vau, sorry.

933
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:12,920
Olge vaiksem.

934
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:12,920
...veidi rahulikumaks.

935
00:27:12,960 --> 00:27:15,640
Richard Hammond.

936
00:27:12,960 --> 00:27:15,640
tema sõnul jõuab Porsche 918 kõige kaugemale.

937
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:18,720
see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see, see. see, see, see, see, see.
that's the one that takes the
