961
00:28:19,120 --> 00:28:25,240
Ma ütlesin talle, et kui see juhtuks...

962
00:28:19,120 --> 00:28:25,240
osutuks ringrajal McLarenist kiiremaks,


963
00:28:19,120 --> 00:28:25,240
