983
00:28:58,120 --> 00:29:00,120
MIS?

984
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
Ootake, meie oma raja kohta ka.

985
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
McLareni rada. Seal me seda testi teeme.

986
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
